// src/engine/runtime.cplus — app-wide background engine controller.
//
// Owns a single background worker thread that drives `Supervisor` and
// `AcpClient`. The main thread never blocks on process I/O: UI handlers push
// typed commands into `_CMD_TX`, and the worker pushes decoded updates into
// `_WorkerArgs.ui_tx` (drained on the main thread from `_UI_RX` via a
// `services::CoalescedHop`).

